# Scripts and docs
# /scripts is excluded from the deploy by default — these are dev /
# build-time helpers, not runtime code. BUT scripts/install-hooks.mjs
# is referenced from package.json's `postinstall`, so Vercel's
# `npm install` step needs it to exist. Without the carve-out below,
# the postinstall fails with MODULE_NOT_FOUND and the deploy aborts.
# The script itself short-circuits when no .git directory is present
# (which is always the case on Vercel), so it never actually mutates
# anything there.
/scripts/*
!/scripts/install-hooks.mjs
*.md
DAHUA_*
DATABASE_*
PROMOTION_*
ATTENDANCE_*
FINANCE_*
ENHANCED_*
IMPLEMENTATION_*
ISSUES_*
MIGRATION_*
NOTIFICATIONS_*
PHASE4_*
QUICK_*
README_*
FIXES_*
DATABASE_*
FIX_*
ESLINT_*
FEATURE_*
FINAL_*

# Database files
database/*.sql
mysql/

# Test files
test-*.sh
crontab.example
